n. Triple-pane windows and 9’ ceilings fill the main floor with natural light. A welcoming foyer leads to a spacious mudroom connecting to a walk-in butler’s pantry with prep sink and bar-fridge space. The chef-inspired kitchen offers quartz countertops, a large island with seating, custom cabinetry, chimney hood fan, built-in microwave, and full-height tile backsplash. The great room features a tiled fireplace and patio door with backyard views. Upstairs, the primary suite includes a 5-piece ensuite with glass shower, double sinks, tiled tub surround, and walk-in closet with direct laundry access. A bright bonus room, double-sink bath, and two bedrooms with walk-in closets complete the level. Finished with luxury vinyl plank flooring, upgraded black fixtures, side entrance, and basement rough-ins, this home delivers style and function in a thriving west-end community. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$669,600"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","3"],["Bathrooms","3"],["Half bathrooms","1"],["Living area","2,250 sq ft"],["Year built","2026"],["Storeys","2"],["Neighbourhood","The Uplands"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T6M3B1"],["MLS® number","E4503106"],["Listed","August 11, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Microwave, Hood Fan, Garage door opener, Garage door opener remote(s)"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Fireplace","Insert, Electric"],["Basement","Unfinished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","4.30 m × 4.19 m (14'1\" × 13'9\")"],["Dining room","Main level","4.30 m × 3.38 m (14'1\" × 11'1\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","4.85 m × 2.69 m (15'11\" × 8'10\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level","4.42 m × 4.40 m (14'6\" × 14'5\")"],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level","4.11 m × 2.81 m (13'6\" × 9'3\")"],["Bedroom 3","Upper Level","3.42 m × 2.84 m (11'3\" × 9'4\")"],["Bonus Room","Upper Level","4.42 m × 3.77 m (14'6\" × 12'4\")"]],"courtesy":"David Lam, Exp Realty and Joe Tolvay, Exp Realty","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug